    {
      "id": "blockchain_mix",
      "title": "理解区块链：从副本到信任边界",
      "genre": "区块链教程",
      "language": "zh-en",
      "path": "videos/blockchain_mix.mp4",
      "duration_ms": 120000,
      "sha256": "62aaf16e2c7332bfa784ee8673bde7642ff7223a0c413042fe3b885041ac1124",
      "bytes": 5432603,
      "voice_path": "assets/voice/blockchain_mix.wav",
      "music_path": "assets/music/blockchain_mix.wav",
      "scenes": [
        {
          "id": "blockchain_mix_s1",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 20000,
          "visual": "六台蓝色电脑围成一圈，通过金色线条连接，中心是一份账本。",
          "utterances": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "区块链中的账本会被多台计算机共同保存。参与者可以检查同一份交易历史。",
              "start_ms": 1000,
              "end_ms": 8357,
              "source": "assets/voice/blockchain_mix/s1_1.wav"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "Several computers keep copies of the same ledger.",
              "start_ms": 8707,
              "end_ms": 11566,
              "source": "assets/voice/blockchain_mix/s1_2.wav"
            }
          ],
          "visual_asset": "assets/images/blockchain-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "blockchain_mix_s2",
          "start_ms": 20000,
          "end_ms": 40000,
          "visual": "三个蓝色区块从左到右排列，用黄色箭头连接。",
          "utterances": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "一个区块可以包含多笔交易。后一个区块保存前一个区块的哈希值。",
              "start_ms": 21000,
              "end_ms": 27228,
              "source": "assets/voice/blockchain_mix/s2_1.wav"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "Each block links to the previous hash.",
              "start_ms": 27578,
              "end_ms": 29828,
              "source": "assets/voice/blockchain_mix/s2_2.wav"
            }
          ],
          "visual_asset": "assets/images/blockchain-2.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "blockchain_mix_s3",
          "start_ms": 40000,
          "end_ms": 60000,
          "visual": "三个相连区块的中间一个变为橙红色，下面显示不一致的哈希标记。",
          "utterances": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "如果有人修改旧记录，对应的哈希通常也会改变。连接哈希，并不等于已经达成共识。",
              "start_ms": 41000,
              "end_ms": 49146,
              "source": "assets/voice/blockchain_mix/s3_1.wav"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "A changed record produces a different hash.",
              "start_ms": 49496,
              "end_ms": 52128,
              "source": "assets/voice/blockchain_mix/s3_2.wav"
            }
          ],
          "visual_asset": "assets/images/blockchain-3.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "blockchain_mix_s4",
          "start_ms": 60000,
          "end_ms": 80000,
          "visual": "五个节点围绕中心账本，四个绿色对号和一个红色叉号。",
          "utterances": [
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "Consensus is the process of agreeing which valid history to follow. Different networks use different consensus rules.",
              "start_ms": 61000,
              "end_ms": 67699,
              "source": "assets/voice/blockchain_mix/s4_1.wav"
            },
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "不同网络采用的共识规则并不相同。",
              "start_ms": 68049,
              "end_ms": 71291,
              "source": "assets/voice/blockchain_mix/s4_2.wav"
            }
          ],
          "visual_asset": "assets/images/blockchain-4.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "blockchain_mix_s5",
          "start_ms": 80000,
          "end_ms": 100000,
          "visual": "深色背景上，金色钥匙和蓝色挂锁并排出现。",
          "utterances": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "私钥用于生成数字签名，证明操作得到了持有者的授权。不要把私钥交给陌生网站。",
              "start_ms": 81000,
              "end_ms": 88863,
              "source": "assets/voice/blockchain_mix/s5_1.wav"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "Keep your private key private.",
              "start_ms": 89213,
              "end_ms": 90930,
              "source": "assets/voice/blockchain_mix/s5_2.wav"
            }
          ],
          "visual_asset": "assets/images/blockchain-5.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "blockchain_mix_s6",
          "start_ms": 100000,
          "end_ms": 120000,
          "visual": "左右两列账本卡片，中间是问号，底部是放大镜。",
          "utterances": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "链上的记录难以篡改，也不能自动保证录入的信息真实。我们仍然需要检查数据来源。",
              "start_ms": 101000,
              "end_ms": 108739,
              "source": "assets/voice/blockchain_mix/s6_1.wav"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "An immutable record is not a guarantee of truth.",
              "start_ms": 109089,
              "end_ms": 111918,
              "source": "assets/voice/blockchain_mix/s6_2.wav"
            }
          ],
          "visual_asset": "assets/images/blockchain-6.png"
        }
      ]
    },
