          "end_ms": 108000,
          "visual": "日出时狐狸和兔子并肩坐在山坡上，提灯放在一旁。",
          "utterances": [
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "By sunrise, the lantern was no longer needed. Sitting on the hill, Milo understood that helping a friend had made the journey brighter.",
              "start_ms": 91000,
